            "postDate": "2026-09-20T08:34:21.717Z",
            "rawMarkdown": "Yes. Back in my graduate post doc work, I helped write some web GUI 3D viewers using quaternions and WebGL. It tooks weeks to get working. We had to get both the math and code working. And now agents can write it in minutes. It is absolutely incredible!",
